# archive's twin, POST /operations/archive, calls run_archive in process for
# all four of the script's modes: plan then apply, --dry-run (the route's
# dry_run returns the plan itself, the text archive.sh --dry-run prints,
# rather than a description of the CLI call), --restore, and
# --reconcile-queues (reconcile_queues, with or without dry_run). A second
# run moves nothing, so the row is "idempotent".
V	archive	active	scripts/archive.sh	project|dry-run|count|restore|reconcile-queues|help	yes	idempotent	POST	/operations/archive	ArchiveBody	action	DualChannelShellEnvelope	module:pgai_agent_kanban.archive.run.run_archive
